Removes upstream's placeholder caffe2/core/macros.h, which CMake overwrites in
the source tree. Here the real header is generated into bazel-bin, which comes
after the source directory on the -iquote search path, so on hosts that do not
sandbox (Windows) the placeholder would win and leave CAFFE2_PERF_WITH_AVX2 etc.
undefined.

diff --git a/caffe2/core/macros.h b/caffe2/core/macros.h
deleted file mode 100644
index ccc0b1b..0000000
--- a/caffe2/core/macros.h
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,4 +0,0 @@
-#pragma once
-
-// This is a placeholder. The real content will be generated by the cmake
-// script.
